nt\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Volume Cost</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Stone\">Stone</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Refined\">Refined</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Forged\">Forged</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Stone\">$33.8 ❄️/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Refined\">~$31 ❄️/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Forged\">~$34 ❄️/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.97.5</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<b>Purple Rock Candy</b> is the purple-coloured variant of Rock Candy. It is worth slightly less per stud than its yellow counterpart.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>It is recommended to sell the candy raw as the increase in price when forged is minimal and the process is simpler and quicker.</li>\n<li>Ores will not spawn in the Rock Candy.</li>\n<li>A full semi-truck (Freyliner Transporter) of Raw Yellow Rock Candy sells for about $60,000 ❄️.<sup>2</sup></li>\n<li>Due to the fact the Rock Candy is transparent, a Grabby/Grabbiest Grabber's field can clip through, creating a transparent region.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>See the image below for an example\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/94/Rock_Candy_%26_Grabby_Grabber_Field.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20251226115923\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Rock Candy &amp; Grabby Grabber Field\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"117\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Rock Candy &amp; Grabby Grabber Field.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Rock_Candy_%26_Grabby_Grabber_Field.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/94/Rock_Candy_%26_Grabby_Grabber_Field.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251226115923\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/94/Rock_Candy_%26_Grabby_Grabber_Field.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20251226115923\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Rock Candy &amp; Grabby Grabber Field\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/94/Rock_Candy_%26_Grabby_Grabber_Field.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251226115923\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"117\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Rock Candy &amp; Grabby Grabber Field.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Rock_Candy_%26_Grabby_Grabber_Field.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/94/Rock_Candy_%26_Grabby_Grabber_Field.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20251226115923\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Rock_Candy_%26_Grabby_Grabber_Field.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><sup>1 - User 'ImCubeNotBall' mentioned the fact it spawns near the Lost Woods on another page.</sup>\n<br /><sup>2 - User 'Pou2.001' mentioned this on another page. It hasn't been verified.</sup>\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:Stone_Nav\" title=\"Template:Stone Nav\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template_t